OL,5,G1700 Seven Worlds One Planet
OL,6,     FAntarctica: David Attenborough
OL,7,     Fnarrates a look at life on each
OL,8,     Fcontinent, revealing how each
OL,9,     Fdistinct land mass has shaped the
OL,10,     Fcreatures found there, beginning
OL,11,     Fwith Antarctica.
OL,12,G1800 Seven Worlds One Planet
OL,13,     FAsia: David Attenborough looks at
OL,14,     Flife in Asia, with footage of
OL,15,     Fwalruses gathering in huge numbers
OL,16,     Fin the frozen north and brown
OL,17,     Fbears roaming around remote
OL,18,     FRussian volcanoes.
